{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In twenty-eighteen, Britain appointed a government minister",
   "start": 0.09,
   "end": 3.29
  },
  {
   "text": "for loneliness.",
   "start": 3.77,
   "end": 4.73
  },
  {
   "text": "Not for trade.",
   "start": 5.229,
   "end": 6.413
  },
  {
   "text": "Not for defence.",
   "start": 6.413,
   "end": 7.895
  },
  {
   "text": "For loneliness.",
   "start": 7.895,
   "end": 8.723
  },
  {
   "text": "A report had found that more than nine million people in the UK often or always felt lonely.",
   "start": 9.26,
   "end": 14.752
  },
  {
   "text": "And that loneliness can be as bad for your health as smoking fifteen cigarettes a day.",
   "start": 15.172,
   "end": 19.693
  },
  {
   "text": "So the government made a plan.",
   "start": 20.2,
   "end": 21.788
  },
  {
   "text": "Doctors could prescribe",
   "start": 22.264,
   "end": 23.492
  },
  {
   "text": "a cooking class.",
   "start": 23.82,
   "end": 24.74
  },
  {
   "text": "A walking club.",
   "start": 25.03,
   "end": 25.79
  },
  {
   "text": "An art group.",
   "start": 26.14,
   "end": 26.67
  },
  {
   "text": "In three places,",
   "start": 27.229,
   "end": 28.043
  },
  {
   "text": "postal workers started checking on lonely people during their rounds.",
   "start": 28.043,
   "end": 31.519
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, in twenty-twenty-one,",
   "start": 32.035,
   "end": 33.418
  },
  {
   "text": "Japan appointed a loneliness minister too.",
   "start": 33.418,
   "end": 36.014
  },
  {
   "text": "And the two ministers had their very first meeting",
   "start": 36.431,
   "end": 38.9
  },
  {
   "text": "online.",
   "start": 39.3,
   "end": 39.88
  },
  {
   "text": "Two countries.",
   "start": 40.346,
   "end": 41.473
  },
  {
   "text": "Two ministers.",
   "start": 41.473,
   "end": 42.711
  },
  {
   "text": "One very big problem.",
   "start": 42.62,
   "end": 44.28
  },
  {
   "text": "But a minister can't sit with you at two in the morning.",
   "start": 44.769,
   "end": 47.344
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 47.755,
   "end": 49.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny listens, remembers your day,",
   "start": 49.78,
   "end": 51.73
  },
  {
   "text": "and is there whenever you need someone to talk to.",
   "start": 52.0,
   "end": 54.28
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 54.72,
   "end": 56.302
  }
 ]
}